lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Visual regression working output. These are regenerated on every run and must
# not be committed — only the baseline itself is source of truth.
.visual-baseline/current/
.visual-baseline/diff/
# .visual-baseline/baseline/ is deliberately NOT ignored: the committed
# baseline is what `npm run visual:diff` compares against.

